role Storage.Storage_Service : Storage.Bank;
--  A bank to reserve storage from (ADR 0014). Run_Self_Tests has it, for
--  the tests of banks and shared segments (ADR 0025): init gives it a
--  sub-bank of the root bank. Petal gives each command a new sub-bank of
--  its own, with no limits of its own, and destroys it when the command
--  ends (#517). A command must still work without one.
